{
  "$proto": true,
  "name": { "type": "string", "required": true, "maxLength": 120 },
  "age": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "required": false },
  "settings": { "type": "object", "properties": { "email_opt_in": { "type": "boolean" } } }
}

(Authoring note: the ¬$proto prefix flags the compact shorthand; runtime will convert to full JSON Schema internally.)
